  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Quiver_items\" title=\"Category:Quiver items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_Item_Slot_Quiver.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Flametouched_Fiddle\">Flametouched Fiddle</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span>\n</p>\n<table class=\"border-color-1\" style=\"clear: right; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #EEBBEE; --bg-color-1:#DDA0DD;--bg-color-1-dark:#773777;--bg-color-2:#FFC2FF;--bg-color-2-dark:#4B224B;--border-color-1:#DDA0DD;--border-color-1-dark:#773777;\" width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\" width=\"50%\">None\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#F0E4F0\" width=\"35%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:QuestionOrb.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/QuestionOrb.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"398\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">Quiver / Quiver\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Account&#160;on Acquire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">100\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Fire_(material)\" title=\"Fire (material)\">Fire</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Fire_(material)\" title=\"Fire (material)\">Fire</a>:</b> Certain rare magical items may be formed from fire and magical energy. These items usually grant bonuses to fire spells.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\" width=\"450\">1 pp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #EEBBEE\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #F0E4F0\"><b><a href=\"/page/Advance_to_level_15\" title=\"Advance to level 15\">Advance to level 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Unique item capacity\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<p>N/A\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Max stack size\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<p>N/A\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Inspiration_of_the_Inferno\" title=\"Inspiration of the Inferno\">Inspiration of the Inferno</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Inspiration_of_the_Inferno\" title=\"Inspiration of the Inferno\">Inspiration of the Inferno</a></b>: While this Fiddle is equipped, you will use it to perform your Bardic Music.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Flametouched_Fiddle.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Flametouched_Fiddle.png/420px-Flametouched_Fiddle.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"256\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Flametouched_Fiddle.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><i>Infernal inscriptions cover this ornate fiddle. While this Fiddle is equipped, you find that your music takes on a Fiendish twist...</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">This fiddle is Bound to Account and has no race requirement (this has been confirmed by equipping the quiver on a heroic-level dwarf bard). On a non-scoundrel, it affects the way bard songs are played, however it does not play on every spell cast as it does on a <a href=\"/page/Tiefling_Scoundrel\" title=\"Tiefling Scoundrel\">Tiefling Scoundrel</a>.\n<ul><li>This animation is slightly faster than the standard lute.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817154217\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.069 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.111 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2718/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 16366/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4267/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n141.70%  135.276     37 Template:IO\n100.00%   95.467      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%   95.467      1 -total\n 95.93%   91.584      1 Template:Quiver\n 47.25%   45.112      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 46.31%   44.211      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 45.30%   43.246      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 44.25%   42.241      2 Template:InCategory\n 17.96%   17.148      1 Template:Mat\n 17.81%   17.001      1 Template:Non-food\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:83179-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817154217 and revision id 678355. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
